      "at": "2026-10-02T05:18:27.454Z",
      "event": "ac-updated",
      "detail": "AC18: \"Each operator message in the topic shows its state on the message itself through a Telegram reaction: received by serve (eyes), accepted into the shell session (reading), turn running (working), turn finished (done), refused or failed (cross). Each state replaces the previous one; a failed reaction call never blocks or delays the message. [verify: exec `bun test src/remote/message-state.test.ts`]\" -> \"Each operator message in the topic shows its state on the message itself through a Telegram reaction: received by serve (eyes), accepted into the shell session (reading), turn running (working), turn finished (done), refused or failed (thumbs-down, because Telegram has no cross reaction). Each state replaces the previous one; a failed reaction call never blocks or delays the message. [verify: exec `bun test src/remote/message-state.test.ts`]\" (Telegram does not offer a cross-mark reaction; thumbs-down is the failed state)"
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-02T05:35:01.307Z",
      "event": "ac-updated",
      "detail": "AC2: \"Text commands (`/help`, `/status`, `/doctor`, `/new`, `/compact`, `/think`, `/goal`, `/queue`, `/plan`, `/reasoning`, `/theme <name>`, `/schedule`, `/rewind`, the jev text commands) run from the topic and their output (today a local transcript line or a toast) comes back to the topic, redacted and rendered like any reply. [verify: exec `bun test src/remote/command-output.test.ts`]\" -> \"Text commands (`/help`, `/status`, `/doctor`, `/new`, `/compact`, `/think <level>`, `/goal`, `/queue`, `/plan`, `/reasoning`, `/theme <name>`, the jev text commands) run from the topic and their output (today a local transcript line or a toast) comes back to the topic, redacted and rendered like any reply. Commands that only open a local modal or panel (`/schedule`, `/rewind`, `/conform`, `/ci`, bare `/theme`, bare `/think`) are refused remotely with the reason. [verify: exec `bun test src/remote/command-output.test.ts`]\" (Implementation found these commands only open local modals, so nothing can come back to the topic; they are refused instead)"
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-02T20:09:38.994Z",
      "event": "origin-set",
      "detail": "unknown -> human-request; quote: \"Еще одно фло, сейчас команды в топике не поддерживаются, проанализируй какие команды из keryx shell мы можем передавать и добавь их в бота. Идея что и keryx и телеграм наши и можем делать из общение максимально удобным . То есть часть функциональности можно вынести в телеграм как интерфейс, который будет выполнять функции на keryx, например /коннект, что бы менять провайдера и модель, то есть в телеграм должно прийти так же список и кнопки, потом выбор модели и так все какие можно. Эффект: я хочу иметь полноценную возможность работать в через телеграмм.\"; source: channel message 176710, 2026-10-01T20:42:01Z (решение оператора 2026-10-02 20:03, flow создан по запросу и корректировкам оператора; decided-by: altsay)"
